quals, negative 8 over 6\"></span>, which simplifies to <span class=\"math-container\"><img align=\"middle\" role=\"math\" class=\"math-img\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"m equals, negative four thirds\"></span>. Only choice C shows an equation with this slope.<br><br>Choices A, B, and D are incorrect and may result from computation errors or misinterpreting the given information.</p>\n"}},"createDate":1691007959618,"updateDate":1691007959618}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959618, 1691007959618),
