$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p class="stem_paragraph ">To earn money for college, Avery works two part-time jobs: A and B. She earns $10 per hour working at job A and $20 per hour working at job B. In one week, Avery earned a total of <span class="italic">s</span> dollars for working at the two part-time jobs. The graph above represents all possible combinations of numbers of hours Avery could have worked at the two jobs to earn <span class="italic">s</span> dollars. What is the value of <span class="italic">s </span>?</p>
