</span>.<p>Choice A is incorrect. This is the third <span class="italic">x</span>-value in the table, not <span class="math-container"><img align="middle" role="math" class="math-img" src="https://bkmyfcolrdumyrwktjrr.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/sat-images/c651cc56/img_008_64069e12.png" alt="f of 3"></span>. Choices C and D are incorrect and may result from errors when calculating the function&rsquo;s rate of change.</p></p>
